<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Password Updated - SONAMONIDER PATHSHALA</title>
  </head>

  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: #f4f6f9;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    "
  >
    <table
      width="100%"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      style="background: #f4f6f9; padding: 40px 0"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            width="600"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            style="
              background: #ffffff;
              border-radius: 12px;
              overflow: hidden;
              box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            "
          >
            <!-- Header -->
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="
                  background: #1e3a8a;
                  padding: 35px 30px;
                  border-bottom: 4px solid #d97706;
                "
              >
                <h1
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    color: #ffffff;
                    font-size: 28px;
                    letter-spacing: 1px;
                    font-weight: 700;
                  "
                >
                  SONAMONIDER PATHSHALA
                </h1>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Body -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 40px">
                <h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1e3a8a; font-size: 22px">
                  Your Password Has Been Updated
                </h2>

                <p style="color: #334155; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px">
                  Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,
                </p>

                <p style="color: #334155; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px">
                  This is to inform you that your
                  <strong>SONAMONIDER PATHSHALA</strong> account password has
                  been successfully updated by an authorized administrator.
                </p>

                <p style="color: #334155; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px">
                  You can sign in using your new password. For your security,
                  the changed password is shown below.
                </p>

                <table
                  width="100%"
                  cellpadding="0"
                  cellspacing="0"
                  style="margin: 26px 0"
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td
                      align="center"
                      style="
                        background: #f0fdf4;
                        border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
                        border-radius: 8px;
                        padding: 22px;
                      "
                    >
                      <div
                        style="
                          color: #153e75;
                          font-family: Consolas, Monaco, monospace;
                          font-size: 24px;
                          font-weight: 700;
                          word-break: break-word;
                        "
                      >
                        <%= updated_user_password %>
                      </div>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- Updated By Information -->
                <table
                  width="100%"
                  cellpadding="0"
                  cellspacing="0"
                  style="
                    margin-top: 25px;
                    background: #f8fafc;
                    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
                    border-radius: 8px;
                  "
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 20px">
                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0 0 12px 0;
                          color: #1e3a8a;
                          font-size: 16px;
                          font-weight: bold;
                        "
                      >
                        Update Information
                      </p>

                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 6px 0;
                          color: #475569;
                          font-size: 14px;
                          line-height: 22px;
                        "
                      >
                        <strong>Updated By:</strong>
                        <%= updated_by %>
                      </p>

                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 6px 0;
                          color: #475569;
                          font-size: 14px;
                          line-height: 22px;
                        "
                      >
                        <strong>Position:</strong>
                        <%= updated_by_position %>
                      </p>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <p
                  style="
                    color: #334155;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 26px;
                    margin-top: 25px;
                  "
                >
                  If you did not expect this password change or believe your
                  account has been modified without your authorization, please
                  contact the school administration immediately.
                </p>

                <hr
                  style="
                    border: none;
                    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
                    margin: 30px 0;
                  "
                />

                <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px">
                  For your security, please do not share your password with
                  anyone. The school administration will never ask you to
                  disclose your password.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="
                  background: #f8fafc;
                  padding: 25px;
                  border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
                "
              >
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px">
                  © <%= year %> SONAMONIDER PATHSHALA. All rights reserved.
                </p>

                <p style="margin-top: 8px; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px">
                  This is an automated operational message from SONAMONIDER
                  PATHSHALA. Please do not reply directly to this email.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
